# The Alliance Rogue level 16 lockpicking chain: one breadcrumb per home town
# to Renzik "The Shiv" at SI:7 in Stormwind (SI:7 2300 from Keryn Sylvius in
# Goldshire; To Hulfdan! and Kingly Shakedown 2299, 2298 from Hogral Bakkan
# in Kharanos; Erion Shadewhisper and Erion's Behest 2259, 2260 from Jannok
# Breezesong in Dolanaar), then Redridge Rendezvous (2281) and Alther's Mill
# (2282, the Certificate of Thievery) with Lucius in Lakeshire.
# Sources: Wowhead Forever's Rogue class page
# (data/local/quest-audit/wowhead-class-quests.json) for which quests Forever
# has, the rewards and Forever's changes (none for this chain);
# quests.json, npcs.json, objects.json and items.json for the givers, drops
# and places.
# Not confirmed in Forever: Horns of Nez'ra (2358), Arantir's follow-up in
# Lakeshire, is in the Classic data but not on Wowhead Forever's Rogue page,
# so it is left out.
# The three breadcrumbs exclude one another: take the one of your town. Their
# race masks take any Alliance race; Skyborne, in Stormwind by about 15,
# take Keryn Sylvius's in Goldshire.
# Alther's Mill gives you Thieves' Tools for Lucius's Lockbox.
# The leveling guides leave these out: they teach no spell.

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- To Renzik

step SI:7 (Goldshire)
  only Human,Skyborne
  zone Elwynn Forest
  tip At 16 Keryn Sylvius, the rogue trainer in the Lion's Pride Inn in Goldshire, sends you to Renzik "The Shiv" in Stormwind.
  level 16
  accept 2300                                 -- Keryn Sylvius

step To Hulfdan! (Kharanos)
  only Dwarf,Gnome
  zone Dun Morogh
  tip At 16 Hogral Bakkan in the Thunderbrew Distillery in Kharanos sends you to Hulfdan Blackbeard, in the north of Ironforge.
  level 16
  accept 2299                                 -- Hogral Bakkan

step Hulfdan Blackbeard
  only Dwarf,Gnome
  zone Ironforge
  turnin 2299                                 -- Hulfdan Blackbeard
  accept 2298

step Erion Shadewhisper (Dolanaar)
  only NightElf
  zone Teldrassil
  tip At 16 Jannok Breezesong in Dolanaar sends you to Erion Shadewhisper in Darnassus.
  level 16
  accept 2259                                 -- Jannok Breezesong

step Erion Shadewhisper
  only NightElf
  zone Darnassus
  turnin 2259                                 -- Erion Shadewhisper, Darnassus
  accept 2260

step Renzik "The Shiv"
  zone Stormwind City
  tip Renzik stands beside Master Mathias Shaw at SI:7 in Old Town. Dwarves and Gnomes take the Deeprun Tram from Ironforge; Night Elves take the boat from Auberdine to Stormwind Harbor.
  turnin 2300 only Human,Skyborne             -- Renzik "The Shiv"
  turnin 2298 only Dwarf,Gnome
  turnin 2260 only NightElf
  accept 2281

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- Lakeshire

step Lucius
  zone Redridge Mountains
  tip Ride east through Elwynn Forest into Redridge, or fly to Lakeshire. Lucius waits on the west side of Lakeshire and gives you Thieves' Tools.
  turnin 2281                                 -- Lucius
  accept 2282

step Alther's Mill
  tip Alther's Mill stands east of Lakeshire, up off the road. Open Lucius's Lockbox there.
  collect 7871 quest 2282.1                   -- Token of Thievery: Lucius's Lockbox

step Back to Lucius
  turnin 2282 reward 7907                     -- Lucius: Certificate of Thievery
